WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.791
- You got a little scared.
- Look at this.

00:00:02.375 --> 00:00:04.666
It twirls nicely with a little bit of coffee on it.

00:00:04.791 --> 00:00:06.166
- They got that pumpkin spice.

00:00:06.166 --> 00:00:07.833
- This is life and death right here for me.

00:00:10.666 --> 00:00:14.000
- Welcome to the punishment
 edition of the B/R

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.166
Gridiron Punishment League.
 Lou and Amanda were teamed up this week

00:00:18.166 --> 00:00:21.875
against FlemLo and I.
 The new underdogs, being us, came back

00:00:21.875 --> 00:00:26.125
and took care of business over
 Scottie Pippen and MJ.

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:29.375
I got freaked out late Sunday afternoon.

00:00:29.375 --> 00:00:32.750
- Jack texted mid-game, "Oh s—-t!"

00:00:32.875 --> 00:00:34.750
- Did you guys think the comeback was on?

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:36.666
- I had hope.
- It was Stafford and Murray.

00:00:36.666 --> 00:00:40.291
We needed some big points
 there late in the fourth, and you got lucky.

00:00:40.375 --> 00:00:42.166
- Thank God.
- We were supposed to dress up

00:00:42.166 --> 00:00:45.291
 as fairies. I am a beer fairy.

00:00:45.291 --> 00:00:49.750
- And I am Father Fairy
 Shlou, just here giving blessings.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:55.041
- I like how they both put like their unique

00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:58.000
little spin on the costume idea.
 They put some thought in it.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:04.041
- The punishment of this week
 is to eat the guts of a pumpkin, and I

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:06.833
am prepared.

00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:09.250
 - Let's get this pumpkin eating going.
- Look at this

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:11.916
- Ooh, the guts.
- I got a little hot sauce.

00:01:11.916 --> 00:01:14.500
- Oh, hot sauce.
- I got a little salt. I got a little pepper.

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:17.500
- Lou came prepared. Lou's making lunch.
- Salt and pepper.

00:01:17.541 --> 00:01:19.166
- I don't eat nothing without no seasoning.

00:01:19.166 --> 00:01:22.250
- Should I pour a little coffee in here?
- Yeah.

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:25.000
- Cheers.
- It's just like oodles of noodles.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:25.750
- Here we go.

00:01:28.375 --> 00:01:32.875
- Ugh. Uh uh.
- What's the best part, the seeds or the guts?

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:35.333
- None of it.
- Is it sweet?

00:01:35.333 --> 00:01:36.750
- No, this s--t ain't sweet.

00:01:36.875 --> 00:01:40.000
- Mine is! I put a little coffee in there.
 Trying to even drink mine like a coffee.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:43.500
- I'm telling you, the hot sauce make it OK.
- We dodged the perfect bullet

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:45.416
because this would have been
 the one took me out right here.

00:01:45.416 --> 00:01:47.166
- I'm telling you, sometimes you just gotta get a little dirty.

00:01:47.166 --> 00:01:51.208
You gotta put the forks and the knives away, the utensils.
 You gotta just put your foot in it.

00:01:51.208 --> 00:01:52.666
It's like my nanna used to say.

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:55.750
- Lot a seeds for you, Lou.
- Ain't go down easy, though. Come on, bro.

00:01:55.750 --> 00:01:57.250
I want my revenge.

00:01:57.250 --> 00:01:59.750
- You were saying 'run it back.'
- They're not eating this pumpkin.

00:01:59.750 --> 00:02:02.375
They're going to underprepare next week.
- Let's run it back, bruh.

00:02:02.416 --> 00:02:03.166
Let's see what happens.

00:02:03.166 --> 00:02:05.791
- I think after this,
 I might rather drink an egg.

00:02:05.916 --> 00:02:08.000
- How many calories we think we're eating right now?

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:09.916
- Hey Jack, don't say we.
[laughter]

00:02:10.166 --> 00:02:12.500
- I'm gonna save this pumpkin,
 and I'm going to carve it.

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:16.750
- Yeah, carve a big, big fat
 L for Lou and losers.

00:02:16.875 --> 00:02:20.291
All right. Get your final bites in.
 We're tapping you guys out.

00:02:20.375 --> 00:02:22.750
- This is all the pumpkin
 I need until next year.

00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:24.000
- Kill or be killed right here.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:26.791
- We shall see you in Week No. 8.

